('ede1b6af-ea39-48ae-856b-78201acc6752','Scene','scene-2026-1402181','Inbaraj, a police officer, is forced to come back from retirement when a new case resembles one he closed years ago. This time, he must solve it with a chaotic and troublesome team. As they struggle to work together and deal with the twists and turns of the case, the investigation takes them on a chaotic and unpredictable ride.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfc4w3OX8QsFm8f9MPUdmGheNl3.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xhBaF3bpEnZhf61klsWaFKkNZF.jpg',NULL,2026,149,8.4,'Tamil','PUBLISHED',NULL,'2026-11-23 18:20:42.617','2026-11-23 18:20:42.617'),
('f03d44b3-9b4f-4154-b921-315d6b607a4f','Flavia','flavia-2026-1129104','The adventures of 11-year-old Flavia de Luce, who is both an amateur detective and a master poisoner. When she discovers a dead body in her family’s decaying British manor house and her father is accused of the murder, Flavia launches her own investigation to uncover family secrets and bring the true murderer to justice.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwm7TGTmQcM2PkVvMxTjpYYk600.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6t9nSqZpD1mlT9DLugyZNmC3SsQ.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wFfvJtE4uBg',2026,92,6.5,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:28:37.649','2026-11-23 17:28:37.651','2026-11-23 17:28:37.651'),
('f3a0b802-959d-45dc-869f-566231fdc8d8','Love of Your Life','love-of-your-life-2026-1381078','After a chance encounter sparks a sweeping romance, Maya\'s future is suddenly upended, sending her on an unexpected journey to love and live again.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dL3Tcv4FU2K85bgnGRBgLjFSrLr.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4hneB0UFKOZAGJHqJ3VhDcG72uH.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HzGx48E64Xg',2026,109,6.7,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:28:59.445','2026-11-23 17:28:59.447','2026-11-23 17:28:59.447'),
('f409a4e5-4be2-4a0f-961a-90c09b4fb2a2','Newborn','newborn-2026-787844','After serving seven years in solitary confinement, Chris Newborn seeks to rebuild his life and reconnect with his family only to find that freedom has become a terrifying psychological battleground.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3fTSiQ19uIpYDHVAHLHvgLwzPD.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/skyvaf7uhxMrQNIy3NZSN77SswS.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2svpfCr-_kU',2026,102,5.4,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:29:15.561','2026-11-23 17:29:15.562','2026-11-23 17:29:15.562'),
('f4701d51-b44f-4fbc-8de9-3c74ed276aa5','Return to Silent Hill','return-to-silent-hill-2026-680493','When James receives a mysterious letter from his lost love Mary, he is drawn to Silent Hill—a once-familiar town now consumed by darkness. As he searches for her, James faces monstrous creatures and unravels a terrifying truth that will push him to the edge of his sanity.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xf7KoifUAjMbhSRcjuZv4Eu0FQ.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v0NEB75SZjxY8GS3ho8WeEvjIT3.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cbFSZ_8r58Y',2026,106,5.3,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:29:44.366','2026-11-23 17:29:44.367','2026-11-23 17:29:44.367'),
('fafdca9d-5613-4984-aa24-d0b824afe573','Anantha','anantha-2026-1608579','An anthology film centered on the divine grace and miracles of Sri Sathya Sai Baba, showcasing how faith transforms lives, featuring stories of a mischievous man\'s redemption and a village facing floods, emphasizing universal love and divinity, not a specific religion','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1GAbomStmF8dnvrsYzUGiqBFy4.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5MUCtRz1iqTOprqAqx9I7lyW58.jpg',NULL,2026,136,2.0,'Hindi (Dubbed)','PUBLISHED',NULL,'2026-11-23 19:13:54.656','2026-11-23 19:13:54.656'),
('fb5c6bae-65c3-4ef4-9c98-64eda496cfd5','72 HOURS','72-hours-2026-949838','To save his career, a 40-year-old ad exec joins a crew of twentysomethings for a wild Miami bachelor party after they mistakenly add him to a group chat.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Bu1PW2R1XayqRqnl0aDOgMcrdS.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hL5EIk48251OXlbIbRJq3yaBHk8.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N-J-HR3quc4',2026,105,6.7,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:28:15.157','2026-11-23 17:28:15.158','2026-11-23 17:28:15.158'),
('fbf43033-280d-4fec-99b1-e88daa1ae8d9','Nothing to Lose','nothing-to-lose-2026-1710008','She gave everything to become a mother, so when her young son falls ill, Jada will stop at  nothing to find a donor and save him — no matter the cost.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SKN8QZptMm8KfCCQtEmyh1Zkgz.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5cEmmIMunNk3JRij4nTitFtikIg.jpg',NULL,2026,102,7.1,'FR','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:29:17.326','2026-11-23 17:29:17.328','2026-11-23 17:29:17.328'),
('fc267f26-9de1-4b67-8a6b-a17a56cbb043','Anbe Diana','anbe-diana-2026-1607634','Set in Perambur, a local Telugu youth falls for an Anglo-Indian girl, sparking a chaotic and humorous clash of cultures between their families.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/201CEvG6ayNj71iSLxxEk7pUv0N.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l4xqxKS7nlOni6bnTHWi3USyp4o.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gcXw7BMSfIQ',2026,150,6.2,'Hindi (Dubbed)','PUBLISHED',NULL,'2026-11-23 19:13:56.567','2026-11-23 19:13:56.567'),
('febbd2e5-a94b-4623-a8f7-1d2b46e7d22e','Passenger','passenger-2026-1368314','After a young couple witnesses a gruesome highway accident, they soon realize they did not leave the crash scene alone, as a demonic presence called the Passenger that won\'t stop until it claims them both turns their van life adventure into a nightmare.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sOEJzhPzjTkZSlPbGxOJ7xgIyS.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iyW6c3kvzFo37Gi0BJgr5EBh8a.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TMw8yXK6bH8',2026,94,7.2,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:29:23.212','2026-11-23 17:29:23.214','2026-11-23 17:29:23.214'),
('fecad0d6-e5c9-4511-874b-ad2ac3edaf11','Lockbox','lockbox-2026-1500890','A woman puts her life on the line to protect her troubled and enigmatic cousin, who has been targeted and hunted by a powerful supernatural force.','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRLuOfJyVJBN6htK6pGoVDUxkPa.jpg','https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5NO5ZasDjCaRgU1Efmtiv1nwLjq.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xxiHWdsM1rM',2026,105,6.3,'EN','PUBLISHED','2026-11-23 17:28:57.727','2026-11-23 17:28:57.729','2026-11-23 17:28:57.729');
